Wi-Fi code from OpenBSD

src/      net80211 (802.11 stack), dev/pci/if_iwm.c (Intel Wireless-AC driver,
          3160..9560) and the crypto helpers they need, copied UNMODIFIED from
          OpenBSD src (git c595b86, 2026-10-28). Licences: see the header of each file
          (ISC / BSD).
include/  the OpenBSD kernel headers those files include (also unmodified).
compat/   TanjaOS's own layer: stub config headers and the implementations of the
          kernel services the OpenBSD code expects (mbufs, timeouts, PCI, DMA, ...).
